schema: yggdrasil.research-successor-policy.v1
parent_experiment: EXP-DGR-EXTERNAL-CUMULATIVE-DEPENDENT-PIPELINE-ORACLE-CANONICAL-INVARIANT-UTILIZATION-089
parent_preregistration_sha: 7494366b39ad8303b4f1e1fccd14638dee754ac7
frozen_before_parent_execution: true
independence: Yggdrasil-only; Wingless cannot validate, alter, or route this policy.
global_constraints:
  - preregister before execution
  - no post-result tuning
  - preserve scientific negatives
  - infra failure distinct from scientific negative
  - no data/compute/capacity expansion
  - genuinely unseen contexts
  - clean-rescue criteria and collateral checks remain frozen
  - one high-information architectural discriminator; no parameter sweep
routes:
  supported:
    experiment_id: EXP-DGR-EXTERNAL-CUMULATIVE-DEPENDENT-PIPELINE-SELF-LEARNED-CANONICAL-INVARIANT-090
    hypothesis: Yggdrasil can learn the same invariant representation that the Y089 harness supplied, under the unchanged 16/7/9 capacity.
    design: >
      Remove oracle relation supply. Fit one preregistered bounded historical-only transform from current retained state to the exact
      Y089 canonical relation alphabet; apply it prospectively to a fresh unseen context. No target outcome, target-context mapping,
      new persistent slots, or extra evaluation budget.
    negative_interpretation: >
      Y089 utilization was real but invariant discovery is not yet endogenous; keep utilization evidence but do not claim learned transfer.
  mixed:
    experiment_id: EXP-DGR-EXTERNAL-CUMULATIVE-DEPENDENT-PIPELINE-INVARIANT-UTILIZATION-STAGE-LOCALIZATION-090
    hypothesis: Partial Y089 benefit is limited by one architectural stage: context transformation, activation, or downstream use.
    design: >
      One fixed three-cell causal localization with the same oracle invariant relation and unchanged capacity: inject only at canonical
      context transformation, only at retained-state activation, or only at downstream consumption. The three cells are frozen together;
      no extra stage variants may be added after results.
    negative_interpretation: No localized stage explains the mixed effect; stop stage micro-variants and move downstream.
  negative:
    experiment_id: EXP-DGR-EXTERNAL-CUMULATIVE-DEPENDENT-PIPELINE-RETAINED-COGNITION-DOWNSTREAM-INTEGRATION-090
    hypothesis: >
      After a clean Y089 negative, the limiting mechanism lies downstream of memory key/gate/factorization representation:
      retained cognition is not integrated into reasoning/developmental dynamics strongly enough to alter capability.
    design: >
      Stop key/gate/factorization changes. Use a frozen retained-cognition input selected before target outcomes and test a single bounded
      downstream integration intervention in the existing reasoning/developmental consumer, with unchanged 16/7/9 capacity and resource budget.
      Clean rescue and partner-collateral rules remain the primary criterion.
    negative_interpretation: >
      Even downstream integration of retained cognition fails under fixed capacity; shift the program to developmental dynamics/consumer
      architecture rather than returning to memory addressing variants.
